    "body": "pulse task #2876 \u00b7 generation 1.\n\n<!-- pulse-operation:0d8280227995ed9bf3b8eed509dcdc12 -->\n\nassigned to @PORTALSURFER. the frozen task plan is retained in pulse and copied below.\n\n# Pulse task #2876: Orchestrate local release qualification and atomic channel publication\n\nOperation: 0d8280227995ed9bf3b8eed509dcdc12\nAssignee: PORTALSURFER (Pulse #1, GitHub ID 41680373)\n\nPlanned stage3 of2873/PR475 final design29878/29880; Todo only. Repository ./scripts/release proposed status/collect/prepare/cut/build/publish/install contract, not current capability. Compose stage1 ledger +stage2 frozen candidate manifests with existing guarded python3 scripts/local-ci.py full exactcandidate and cargo build --release -p hex-desktop --locked/native signing checks. Reuse optimized_artifact and checked packaging; expose nonactivating release staging without touching the running/installed app, then publish immutable artifact/notes/manifest locally under artifacts/releases/channel/version and update channel index LAST. This owns release CLI/catalog composition, not2746's deferred save/quit/restart UI/supervisor or2748's public network updater. Share/reuse their preparation/signing boundaries and coordinate helper ownership; do not duplicate installers/frameworks. Keep org.portalsurfer.hex.dev, samepath explicit install contract/settings/projects/media/currentdefaultlaunch fetch-build-open/testsoptin. No scheduled app install/signals/forcequit. Exact candidate source, build sequence, includedPR heads, resource/artifact digests/signature proof/CI coverage recorded; Linux passes not nativeMac proof. Separate build/publication/install/manualacceptance, fail/retry stages truthfully, no version overwrite. Initial publication LOCAL ONLY; no credentials/server/notarization submit/appcast/remote push/new service authorized by this planning ticket. Acceptance: freeze beforeCI, changednotes/source invalidation, real optimized nonactivating native artifact, failedchecks/signing/interruptedpublish/concurrentcollision preserve priorrelease/index, idempotentverified retry and existing samepath installer regressions. Full CI remains local; no hostedCI or Pulse lifecycle engine.\n\ncreated by pulse shared PR intake/start task. builds, checks and merging follow the repository's own instructions.",
